Z||000005||LZeitgeist||07-25-2001||09:31 PM||||X marks the spot because it defines a specific point. O doesn't mark the spot, because it defines an area. <P>In Xmas, it's slang for a cross, referring to Christ. <P>In most other uses (X-rays, X-planes, etc.), it refers to an experimental device or or unproven theory.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
