Z||000009||TRiAD||07-25-2001||10:43 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by LZeitgeist:<BR><B>...In Xmas, it's slang for a cross, referring to Christ...</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>Close, but <B>X</B> is a literal symbol for Christ, stemming from a Greek symbol. It just happens to share it's basic design with a cross. <P>Funny aside, Christian "Generation X'ers" have taken this political label in stride, saying this makes them (us) "the Christ Generation". <P><P>------------------<BR><B><I>Michael ~ triadtuning@hotmail.com</I></B><BR>-----------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/88FieroGTwhitefscustomcroppedmini.jpg"> <BR><I>Photoshop rendering of planned exterior modifications.</I>||||reg||1
